          "text": "When a human operator trusts his or her autonomous vehicle to operate safely, detect hazards and react accordingly, an accident related to self-driving technology can be unexpected and devastating. Injuries such as broken bones, soft-tissue damage, back and spine injuries, and traumatic brain injuries may occur.",
